msgstr "Drawn in 3D: one view for each eye. Its far side stands at your depth limit."

msgid "Drawn in 2D: the same picture in both eyes, at the screen. It joins the show when ticked."
msgstr "Drawn in 2D: the same picture in both eyes, at the screen. It joins the show when ticked."

