msgid "The show also plays after a manual lock while the screen is on. The desktop and the lock screen each keep their own background: a picture, a slide show, a stereo image or a video is chosen on Wallpaper for the desktop and on Screen Locking for the lock screen."
msgstr "The show also plays after a manual lock while the screen is on. The desktop and the lock screen each keep their own background: a picture, a slide show, a stereo image or a video is chosen on Wallpaper for the desktop and on Screen Locking for the lock screen."

msgid "The video background is not installed (the package %1). Install it to choose a video on Wallpaper and on Screen Locking."
msgstr "The video background is not installed (the package %1). Install it to choose a video on Wallpaper and on Screen Locking."

